  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">On October 22, 2026, the Evergreen Area Chamber of Commerce hosted its 12th Annual Women in Business Luncheon at Mount Vernon Canyon Club. The event brought together members of the local business community to celebrate the achievements, leadership, and contributions of women in business.</p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\n<p>The luncheon highlighted the importance of supporting women entrepreneurs, building professional connections, and recognizing the women who make a positive impact throughout the mountain community.</p>\n<p>At The Drake Law Firm, we value opportunities to connect with our local community and celebrate the individuals who help it grow and thrive. Supporting women in business means encouraging leadership, fostering meaningful relationships, and recognizing the contributions that make our community stronger.</p>\n<p>We appreciate the Evergreen Area Chamber of Commerce for organizing this event and creating opportunities to celebrate women’s achievements.</p>\n<p><strong>At The Drake Law Firm, we are proud to be part of a community that supports and empowers women in business.</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-11848\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-3115D4FA-FF66-462F-8156-37743E009D8D-300x225.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-3115D4FA-FF66-462F-8156-37743E009D8D-300x225.jpeg 300w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-3115D4FA-FF66-462F-8156-37743E009D8D-1024x769.jpeg 1024w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-3115D4FA-FF66-462F-8156-37743E009D8D-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-3115D4FA-FF66-462F-8156-37743E009D8D-1536x1153.jpeg 1536w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-3115D4FA-FF66-462F-8156-37743E009D8D.jpeg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-11847\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-C073BCBE-B1FA-4F9B-B08F-4E7CFC4F4BA7-300x225.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-C073BCBE-B1FA-4F9B-B08F-4E7CFC4F4BA7-300x225.jpeg 300w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-C073BCBE-B1FA-4F9B-B08F-4E7CFC4F4BA7-1024x769.jpeg 1024w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-C073BCBE-B1FA-4F9B-B08F-4E7CFC4F4BA7-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-C073BCBE-B1FA-4F9B-B08F-4E7CFC4F4BA7-1536x1153.jpeg 1536w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-C073BCBE-B1FA-4F9B-B08F-4E7CFC4F4BA7.jpeg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-11845\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-4ED74039-7055-4568-B3A9-679F1D9B042C-225x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-4ED74039-7055-4568-B3A9-679F1D9B042C-225x300.jpeg 225w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-4ED74039-7055-4568-B3A9-679F1D9B042C-769x1024.jpeg 769w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-4ED74039-7055-4568-B3A9-679F1D9B042C-768x1023.jpeg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-4ED74039-7055-4568-B3A9-679F1D9B042C-1153x1536.jpeg 1153w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/processed-4ED74039-7055-4568-B3A9-679F1D9B042C.jpeg 1501w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></p>\n"
